Subject: twinapi.appcore, windows.ui, windows.ui.xaml, combase, windows.applicationmodel: Xbox Accessories startup

ApplicationViewTitleBar (colours are stored and returned), Windows.UI.Colors (the 141 named colours),
Application.Resources[key] finding the framework theme resources, RoCaptureErrorContext, and
DesignMode.DesignModeEnabled / DesignMode2Enabled returning false instead of E_NOTIMPL.

